# Zwiggy-Antigravity - Medallion Data Warehouse Platform

[![Python 3.10+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
[![Architecture](https://img.shields.io/badge/Architecture-Medallion%20(Bronze%20%E2%86%92%20Silver%20%E2%86%92%20Gold)-green.svg)]()

Production-grade, metadata-driven Medallion Data Warehouse platform for **Zwiggy Analytics Platform** capstone project.

---

## Architecture Overview

```
Source System (zwiggy_db)
    │
    ▼ (Source-to-Bronze Ingestion)
Bronze Layer (br_*)  ── raw JSON payload + technical metadata
    │
    ▼ (Bronze-to-Silver Cleansing & Conformance)
Silver Layer (slv_*) ── conformed status, cohort tagging, DQ flags
    │                     ├──► Silver Quarantine (slv_*_quarantine)
    ▼ (Silver-to-Gold Dimensional Build)
Gold Layer (dim_*, fact_*, mart_*) ── 14 SCD2 dims, 6 facts, 2 aggregate marts
```

---

## Key Features

1. **Metadata-Driven Ingestion**: 18 source tables classified into `TIMESTAMP_WATERMARK`, `CREATED_DATE_WATERMARK`, `FULL_SNAPSHOT`, and `FULL_REFERENCE` strategies.
2. **Cohort Boundary Management**: Automatically tags orders into `COHORT_A` (order_id ≤ 10,928, human status vocabulary) vs `COHORT_B` (order_id > 10,928, machine vocabulary).
3. **Data Quality & Quarantine Framework**: Evaluates 40+ DQ rules, routes failing records to quarantine tables, and publishes daily quality scorecard.
4. **SCD2 Dimensional Modeling**: 14 SCD2 dimensions with surrogate keys (`*_sk`), `valid_from_utc`, `valid_to_utc`, `is_current`, and MD5 change detection (`dw_row_hash`).
5. **As-At Fact Resolution**: 6 Gold fact tables joining to dimensions at event timestamp, with fallback key `-1` and `dq_flag_dim_fallback`.
6. **Mandatory Reconciliation Engine**: Evaluates 10 cross-layer reconciliation contracts (RC-1 through RC-10).

---

## Quick Start

```bash
# Activate virtual environment
source venv/bin/activate

# Run test suite
pytest

# Execute end-to-end Medallion pipeline
python -m zwiggy_dwh.cli run-all
```

